603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (At our meeting on 10 October we decided to cut the turret. Regionals were four weeks away and our goBILDA parts were delayed, so we needed to save time. The turret was the least necessary part. We kept swerve and the blocker, which still speed up shooting, and spent the time making the intake, transfer, swerve, autos and code consistent. The swerve base now turns the robot to aim \(page 13\).)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [44]
>>
